   1036  ff00				   LaserHitTestBody
   1037  ff00		       4c 5a f2 	      jmp	LaserWallClamp	; contact: tip-cell wall test FIRST (A=2 or
   1038  ff03							; fall into the enemy loop via LaserClampDone)
   1039  ff03				   LaserClampDone
