   1063  ff2a		       69 07		      adc	#7	; kill == drawn overlap: beam [A-7,A] x
   1064  ff2c							; enemy [eX-7,eX] (SAME arg-box convention
   1065  ff2c							; CheckEnemyHit uses for RoomX vs eX) ->
   1066  ff2c							; eX in [A-7, A+7] <=> (eX-A)+7 in [0..14].
   1067  ff2c							; S6b's adc #14 was a 7px-LEFT shift: it
   1068  ff2c							; killed empty space left of the beam and
   1069  ff2c							; missed every enemy overlapping the tip
   1070  ff2c							; from the right (laser_collision_tip_bug).
